WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.920
I THINK CHRISTIE NOEM SHOULD HAVE CONSEQUENCES.

00:02.040 --> 00:03.440
I THINK SHE SHOULD BE TRIED AT THE Hague.

00:03.440 --> 00:08.200
WHAT WE ARE SEEING FROM HER OPERATION ARE CRIMES AGAINST HUMANITY.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.900
AGENTS HAVE $10,000 DEATH WARRANTS AND ARE GETTING DOCKS WITH TRACKING APPS.

00:14.620 --> 00:17.160
IN PORTLAND, AN AMERICAN CITY, DOESN'T CARE.

00:17.800 --> 00:20.360
ICE AGENTS CAN'T EVEN PULL IN AND OUT OF THEIR OFFICE.

00:21.020 --> 00:24.080
ICE AGENTS HAVE BEEN HIT WITH STICKS, SHOT WITH FIREWORKS,

00:24.380 --> 00:27.140
ROASTED BY LASERS AND PELTED WITH PAINT BALLS.

